  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_INJ_TRIG_EXT_TIM3_CH4
  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_INJ_TRIG_EXT_TIM4_TRGO
  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_INJ_TRIG_EXT_EXTI_LINE15
