  *         If 7-bit Address Detection is selected in ADDM7,
  *         only 8bits (b7-b0) of returned value are relevant (b31-b8 are not relevant)
  * @rmtoll CR2          ADD           LL_LPUART_GetNodeAddress
  * @param  LPUARTx LPUART Instance
