      (+) compute the 7, 8, 16 or 32-bit CRC value of an 8, 16 or 32-bit data buffer
          using combination of the previous CRC value and the new one.

       [..]  or

      (+) compute the 7, 8, 16 or 32-bit CRC value of an 8, 16 or 32-bit data buffer
          independently of the previous CRC value.

@endverbatim
