/** @defgroup DSI_Group2 IO operation functions
  *  @brief    IO operation functions
  *
@verbatim
 ===============================================================================
                      #####  IO operation functions  #####
 ===============================================================================
    [..]  This section provides function allowing to:
      (+) Handle DSI interrupt request

@endverbatim
