      (+) HAL_FDCAN_IsRestrictedOperationMode     : Check if the FDCAN peripheral entered Restricted Operation Mode
      (+) HAL_FDCAN_ExitRestrictedOperationMode   : Exit Restricted Operation Mode

@endverbatim
