     (+) HAL_SMARTCARDEx_DisableFifoMode() API disables the FIFO mode
     (+) HAL_SMARTCARDEx_SetTxFifoThreshold() API sets the TX FIFO threshold
     (+) HAL_SMARTCARDEx_SetRxFifoThreshold() API sets the RX FIFO threshold
@endverbatim
  * @{
