/** @defgroup TIM_Exported_Functions_Group7 TIM IRQ handler management
  *  @brief    TIM IRQ handler management
  *
@verbatim
  ==============================================================================
                        ##### IRQ handler management #####
  ==============================================================================
  [..]
    This section provides Timer IRQ handler function.

@endverbatim
