             (++) |2WS(3 CPU cycles)|  64 < HCLK <= 96  |  50 < HCLK <= 75 | 25 < HCLK <= 37.5| 0 < HCLK <= 24    |
             (++) |-----------------|-------------------|------------------|------------------|-------------------|
             (++) |3WS(4 CPU cycles)|  96 < HCLK <= 128 |  75 < HCLK <= 100| 37.5 < HCLK <= 50|                   |
             (++) |-----------------|-------------------|------------------|------------------|                   |
             (++) |4WS(5 CPU cycles)|  128 < HCLK <= 160|                  |                  |                   |
